### Pruebas locales de ms-andesstay-notify (extensión "REST Client" de VS Code)
### Publican directo en RabbitMQ usando su API de administración (guest/guest).
@rabbit = http://localhost:15672/api
@auth = Basic Z3Vlc3Q6Z3Vlc3Q=

### 1. Flujo feliz: mensaje válido a q.cmd.email (cada envío usa un eventId nuevo)
POST {{rabbit}}/exchanges/%2F/cmd.direct/publish
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "properties": { "content_type": "application/json" },
  "routing_key": "email.send",
  "payload_encoding": "string",
  "payload": "{\"type\":\"RESERVATION_CREATED\",\"eventId\":\"{{$guid}}\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-15T10:00:00Z\",\"traceId\":\"t-1\",\"correlationId\":\"c-1\",\"payload\":{\"reservationId\":1,\"guestName\":\"Juan Perez\",\"guestEmail\":\"juan@example.com\",\"propertyName\":\"Hostal Andes\",\"roomNumber\":\"101\",\"checkIn\":\"2026-11-01\",\"checkOut\":\"2026-11-04\",\"totalAmount\":50000,\"currency\":\"CLP\",\"operatorEmail\":\"operador@andesstay.cl\",\"specialRequests\":null}}"
}

### 2. Housekeeping
POST {{rabbit}}/exchanges/%2F/cmd.direct/publish
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "properties": { "content_type": "application/json" },
  "routing_key": "housekeeping.ticket",
  "payload_encoding": "string",
  "payload": "{\"type\":\"RESERVATION_CONFIRMED\",\"eventId\":\"{{$guid}}\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-15T10:00:00Z\",\"traceId\":\"t-2\",\"correlationId\":\"c-2\",\"payload\":{\"reservationId\":2,\"guestName\":\"Ana Soto\",\"guestEmail\":\"ana@example.com\",\"propertyName\":\"Cabana Lago\",\"roomNumber\":\"C-3\",\"checkIn\":\"2026-11-02\",\"checkOut\":\"2026-11-05\",\"totalAmount\":90000,\"currency\":\"CLP\",\"operatorEmail\":\"operador@andesstay.cl\",\"specialRequests\":\"cama extra\"}}"
}

### 3. Voucher
POST {{rabbit}}/exchanges/%2F/cmd.direct/publish
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "properties": { "content_type": "application/json" },
  "routing_key": "voucher.gen",
  "payload_encoding": "string",
  "payload": "{\"type\":\"RESERVATION_CONFIRMED\",\"eventId\":\"{{$guid}}\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-15T10:00:00Z\",\"traceId\":\"t-3\",\"correlationId\":\"c-3\",\"payload\":{\"reservationId\":3,\"guestName\":\"Luis Rojas\",\"guestEmail\":\"luis@example.com\",\"propertyName\":\"Lodge Volcan\",\"roomNumber\":\"L-7\",\"checkIn\":\"2026-11-10\",\"checkOut\":\"2026-11-12\",\"totalAmount\":120000,\"currency\":\"CLP\",\"operatorEmail\":\"operador@andesstay.cl\",\"specialRequests\":null}}"
}

### 4. Mensaje inválido (fecha mal escrita) → no se puede convertir → DLQ directo
POST {{rabbit}}/exchanges/%2F/cmd.direct/publish
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "properties": { "content_type": "application/json" },
  "routing_key": "email.send",
  "payload_encoding": "string",
  "payload": "{\"type\":\"RESERVATION_CREATED\",\"eventId\":\"{{$guid}}\",\"payload\":{\"reservationId\":9,\"checkIn\":\"esto-no-es-una-fecha\"}}"
}

### 5. Ver cuántos mensajes hay en las colas y DLQ
GET {{rabbit}}/queues/%2F
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 6. PRODUCER: publicar una notificación por la API (en dev no pide token; en prod: Authorization: Bearer <token de Azure>)
# canal: EMAIL | HOUSEKEEPING | VOUCHER
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/notificaciones/enviar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "canal": "EMAIL",
  "reservationId": 10,
  "guestName": "Ana Soto",
  "guestEmail": "ana@example.com",
  "propertyName": "Cabaña Lago",
  "roomNumber": "C-3",
  "checkIn": "2026-11-02",
  "checkOut": "2026-11-05",
  "totalAmount": 90000,
  "currency": "CLP",
  "operatorEmail": "operador@andesstay.cl",
  "specialRequests": "cama extra"
}

### 7. Ver el historial (el consumer ya procesó el mensaje del paso 6)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/notificaciones
